<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">YAK- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Yakomba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uje uasonekele Yakomba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakomba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uje uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">YAKOMBA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Yakomba valisonekele kuli umo ivatumbula nguavo Yakomba. Ou ikeye vene Yakomba munaina ya Yesu, uje uapuile ntuama ku cikungulukilo ca kulivanga kaha uapuile umo uavo vaka mpunga ya Yelusalema (Vilinga 15:13) Kaha kanganda Paulu uamusanene nguendi ‘cisimi’ ua cikungulukilo (Ngalata 2:9) Vaka kulilongesa cikuma vatsiliela nguavo livulu lia Yakomba valisonekele kusetekesa mu miaka yakupua makumi atanu (50) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu. Muomu Yakomba ikeye uapuile ntuama mu cikungulukilo ca ku Yelusalema, kaha uasonekele livulu eli oku tele ali kuje.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakomba uasonekelele livulu liendi ku “miyati likumi na ivali” ije ya lishandokela mu mafuti (1:1) Vilongesa vije vili muli Yakomba vasa kulikuasesavio kuli vaka Kilistu voshe vuno honi vukuasi vua lizi “Likumi na ivali lia miyati” cimuesa vene ngeci cilivene Yakomba uasonekelele lika kuli vaka Kilistu va Vayunda. Muomu eli livulu valipangelele linga lihete ku vantuama vavengi, lili nakuhandeka ha mitue yaingi. Yakomba ali nakuhakela mana cikuma ha vusamba vua lutsilielo na vilinga. Lutsilielo lua vusunga vakalumuesa mu vilinga 2:17 Kaha naua uakele nakunangula ha kahangu kuli vaka kufuka 2:1-4 kaha nakutuleka linga tuzangame kuli vije vitukahandeka 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yakomba ahana vihindu ku vantu vaje vasonekelele 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako asimpisa vaka Kilistu linga vakolese mu tuyando 1:2-27</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ambahoni ahandeka muje vati casiua lutsilielo kulumuesa kuhitila mu vilinga 2:1-26</para>
  <para style="io1">4 Hanima yevi ahandeka vati muje mezi asa kukala na nzili 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Kaha Yakomba alumbununa muje vati mana a Njambi mualisezelamo na mana a mavu 3:13; 4:10</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Cakuhatako anangula vantu vendi vaje vasonekelele ha kulihalesa 4:11; 5:6</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Yakomba amanusula livulu liendi 5:7-20 mukuhana vishika lika.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Yange Yakomba, ngamba ua Njambi na Muene Yesu Kilistu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Vihindu ku miyati likumi na ivali ije ya lishandoka ha mavu oshe.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo na mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Vamuanetu, vitambuleni vioshe kupua ngue nzolela, omo muuana vieseko viakuliseza seza, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />muomu muazivuka ngueni kueseka ca lutsilielo lueni cineha lukakateya. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Kaha eceleni lukakateya lumanese cipangi caluo, linga mupue vakukola nakushula kuakuhona cimo. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Nga umo ueni najena mana, mueceleni linga alombe kuli Njambi, uje muka kuhana vantu na mutima umo kuakuhona kutala ku vupi vuavo, kaha aka muhanavio. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Vuno honi napandele kulomba mu lutsilielo, kuakuhona kulikanouela, muomu uoshe uje alikanouela napu ngue linkimba lia cisali lije lipekumuka nakuya kuoshe kuje kuitonda mpunzi. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Muntu uje uacifua eci keti avandamene nguendi akatambula cimo kuli Muene. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Muomu muntu uacifua eci napu ua mitima ivali, kaha akataliangela mu vioshe akalingi.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vuhutu na vufuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Eceleni muanoko uakulikehesa linga alihalese omo Njambi amujundula. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Vuno honi muka kufuka napande kuvuahelela omo Njambi amukehesa, muomu akaua ngue vintemo via muila. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Muomu litangua likatuhuka na vitsantse vialio viakuyukuma nakuletuisa muila, kaha na vintemo viauo viua, kaha na vucili vuauo vunonga. Mucifua cimo vene na muka kufuka akanonga hakati ka mingoso yendi.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kueseka na vieseko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Uakukuisula muntu uje ahiana vieseko, muomu nga na vihiana, kaha akatambula cilongo ca muono cije Njambi nakulahesa kuli vaje vamuzanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Muntu keti ahandeke omo vamueseka nguendi, “Njambi ikeye nanjeseka.” Muomu Njambi kuvekumueseka na vupi kaha na ikeye kekueseka muntu. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Vuno honi muntu uoshe vakamueseka omo vamukokela kueka na mashungu endi amapi. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ambahoni lishungu omo limita kaha lisema vupi, kaha vupi omo vukola cikuma kaha vuneha kutsa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Vamuanetu vanjazanga, keti vamikuise. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Cuma coshe cacili na vuana vua vusunga vikahumu kuilu, vikahuminina kuli Tate ua vieke ikeye uje kekutenguluka ngue mu cikatenguluka cimbembe. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Mucizango cendi vavenia uatutangele na lizi lia vusunga linga tupue cifua ca vushuka vuakulivanga ku via kutanga viendi.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvua na kulinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Zivukeni eci, vamuanetu vanjazanga. Muntu uoshe napande kuvua vuasi, kaha akotokele mukuhandeka, kaha naua akotokele mukuniengua, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />muomu kuniengua ca muntu kucekuneha vusunga vuje vuatonda Njambi. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nankuma, umbileni viuma vioshe via mazilo na vilinga via vipi kaha mukulikehesa tambuleni lizi lije vanakunu muli yeni, lije liasa kuovola miono yeni.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Keti mupue vaka kuvua lika lizi, nakulikuisa yeni vavenia. Vuno honi lingeni na vije vilihandeka. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Muomu nga umo apua muka kuvua lika lizi vuno honi kekulinga vije vilihandeka, kaha napu ngue muntu uje ali nakulitala cihanga cendi ha kalivanjelo, <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />kaha hanima yakulitala ikeye vavenia, kaha aya, omo aya hajevene asuva muje muanamonekela. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Vuno honi uoshe atala ha lishiko lia vusunga, lishiko lia kupatuka, na kukakateya, kupua muka kuvua uakuhona kusuva vuno honi muka kulinga vilinga, akapua ua kukuisula mu vilinga viendi.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Nga kuli umo asinganieka nguendi ikeye ualihana kuli Njambi, vuno honi kakuata ndaka yendi, akuisa mutima uendi, kaha vunjambi vua muntu ou vunapu vuangoco. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Vunjambi vua vusunga nakulela ku mesho a Njambi na Tate vukevuo ovu, vua kukuasa vantsiua na vantuluue mu makalu avo, nakulihumisa ikeye vavenia ku vupi vuahano ha mavu.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Cinangulo caha kahangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Vamuanetu, vaka kutsiliela muli Muene ua vumpau Yesu Kilistu keti mumuese kahangu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Muomu nga muntu ali na tunzeya tua ngolinde kaha nazala na mu vuzalo viacili mu cikungulukilo ceni, kaha na yala ua cihutu uje nazala vuzalo vua kusanioka na ikeye naua eja mu cikungulukilo ceni. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Kaha nga mumuesa kasingimiko cikuma kuli muntu uje nazala vuzalo vuacili nakuhandeka ngueni, “Cituamo cacili cino ija utumameho,” vuno honi muhandeka kuli uje yala ua cihutu ngueni, “Yove imana kuje,” cipue ngueni, “Tumama ha mavu ku viliato viange,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />kaha nkuma kumualingile kahangu hakati keni vavenia, nakupua vaka kusompa na visinganieka via vipi ndi?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Ivuilileni, vamuanetu vanjazanga. Nkuma Njambi kahanguile vaje vakuhutua ha mavu kupua vaka kufuka mu lutsilielo nakusuana vumuene vuje vuakulahesele vaje vamuzanga ndi? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Vuno honi kumua musingimikile uje yala ua cihutu. Nkuma keti muka kufuka ikeye akamiyandesa, nkuma keti vakevo vakamituala ku nzango na ku misompesa ndi? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Nkuma keti vakevo vaje vakashaula lizina lia kasingimiko lia ikeye uje kumuakundama ndi?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Nga cilivene muniunga lishiko lije lili mu visoneka ngualio, “Zanga mukueni ngue muje mu ualizanga yove vavenia,” kaha mulina kulinga muacili. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Vuno honi nga mumuesa kahangu, kaha mulina kulinga vupi, kaha lishiko limihisa kupua vakakupokola lishiko. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Muomu uoshe uje aniunga mashiko oshe vuno honi nga apokolaho limo kaha alina mulonga ku oshe. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Muomu ikeye uje uahandekele nguendi, “Keti ulinge vupangala,” kaha naua nguendi, “Keti utsihe.” Nga kumualingile vupangala vuno honi mutsiha, munapu vaka kupokola lishiko. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Nankuma, handekeni nakulinga ngue vantu vaje va vakasompa na lishiko lia kupatula. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Muomu kusompa cakuhona cikeketima vakacimuesa kuli uje uakuhona cikeketima, kaha cikeketima cikahiana kusompa.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo na vilinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Nkuma cikuasa vikahoni vamuanetu, nga muntu ahandeka nguendi ali na lutsilielo, vuno honi kuakuhona vilinga? Nkuma lutsilielo luendi luasa kumuovola ndi? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Nga muanoko ua yala cipue muanoko uampuevo kesi na vuzalo cipue viakulia via ha litangua na litangua, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />kaha nga umo ueni ahandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni mu ciyulo, kaleni muntuima kaha mukalie na kukuta,” kuakuhona ku vahana viuma vije vivatonda ku muvila, nkuma eci cikuasa vikahoni? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Mucifua cimo vene, lutsilielo halukalialuo nga kuluesi na vilinga, lunatsi.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Vuno honi umo akahandeka nguendi, “Yove uli na lutsilielo kaha yange njili na vilinga.” Njimuese lutsilielo luove kuakuhona vilinga, kaha yange njikakumuesa lutsilielo luange ha vilinga viange. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Unatsiliela nguove Njambi uapua umo lika. Muacili! Cipue vene mahamba vatsiliela kaha vakajaja na liova. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Yove cilema, nkuma utonda vukaleho ngeci lutsilielo lua kuhona vilinga luapua luangoco ndi? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nkuma keti tatetu Avilahama ivapuisile ua vusunga ha vilinga, omo uatondele kulambuila munendi Isake ha mutula ndi? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Kaha muamono ngueni lutsilielo luendi na vilinga viendi viakele nakupangela hamo, kaha na lutsilielo luendi luapuile lua kutungukua na vije vialingile <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />kaha visoneka via lishulisisile vije vihandeka nguavio, “Avilahama uatsilielele Njambi kaha vamutumbuile kupua ua vusunga.” Kaha vamutumbuile naua kupua kavusamba ua Njambi. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Kaha muamono ngueni muntu vakamupuisa ua vusunga na vilinga keti na lutsilielo lika.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kaha mucifua cimo vene, nkuma keti Lahave uje cikuizi vamupuisile ua vusunga mu vilinga viendi omo uatambuile vaje vavatumine, kaha uavalekele linga vahiluke mukulikuasesa ngila yeka ndi?<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Mungila imo vene, muvila nga ulihangununa na cimbembesi kaha unatsi, kaha mucifua cimo vene lutsilielo luakuhona vilinga lunatsi.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Ndaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Vamuanetu, keti vuingi vueni mupue valongisi, muomu muazivuka ngueni yetu vaka kulongesa vaka tusompa cikuma na vukalu. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Muomu tuva voshe tukapihisa viavingi, kaha nga kuli umo kekupihisa mu vihandeka viendi kaha napu yala uavusunga, kaha naua asa nakuniunga muvila uendi uoshe. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Nga tuhaka vikuvo mu tunua tua tuvalu linga vatuononoke, tuasa kuvalinga kuya kuoshe kuje tutonda kuya. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Taleni ha mato akama naua, cipue vene akama akapekumuka na mpunzi yakama, vuno honi vaka atuamenena na cikasi cacindende ca kulipasha, kaha vukayi kuoshe kuje mukakuendesa atonda linga vuye. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Mu cifua cimo vene na ndaka yapua cilio cacindende ku muvila, vuno honi ikalihalesa ha viuma viakama. Singaniekeni ha musenge uakama uje ukauema na tuhia tuatundende! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kaha ndaka inapu tuhia. Kaha ndaka naua inapu mavu a vupi hakati ka vilio via muvila. Ikapihisa muvila uoshe, ikashuameka tuhia ku muono uoshe ua muntu, kaha na ikeyo vakaishuameka mu tuhia mu ngehena. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Muomu cifua coshe ca vikashama na tuzila, na tusitu vakulikoka ha mavu na viakutanga via mu cisali viasa kuniungiua kaha naua vanavaniungu laja ku muntu, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />vuno honi naumo uahi muntu asa kuniunga ndaka. Vupi vuje kuvuekuhuima, vuashulu na vusungu vuakutsiha. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Na ndaka tukalemesa Muene na Tate, na ikeyo naua tukasingi vantu, vaje Njambi uatangele mucifua cendi. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu kanua kamolika vene mukemo mukahumu kukuisula na kusinga. Vamuanetu, eci kucapandele kupua ngoco. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Nkuma livuelu vuelu likahumisa mema akushasha na acili ha ntsimbu imo lika ndi? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Vamuanetu, nkuma muti ua mukuyu uasa kuima vushuka vua Olive, cipue muti ua viniu uasa kuima vushuka vua mukuyu ndi? Nalimo liahi lisima lia mema a muongua liasa kuhumisa mema acili.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana akuhuma kuilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nkuma iya ali na mana nakuvuisisa hakati keni? Ha vuyoye vuendi vuacili eceleni linga amuese vipangi viendi mukulikehesa ku mana. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Vuno honi nga uli na cipululu cacipi na visinganieka via kulizanga mu mutima uove, keti ulihalese kaha upue ua makuli ku vusunga. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Aua mana kahumu muilu, vuno honi aha mavu, akuhona kulela, a mahamba. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Muomu kuje kuli cipululu na visinganieka via kulizanga, kukeko naua kuje kukakala naua nakupihisa na vilinga vioshe via vupi. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Vuno honi mana aje akahumu kuilu akeuo apua akulivanga ku kulela, ambahoni ciyulo, na kulikehesa, na kulihana, na kushula na cikeketima na vushuka vuacili, cakuhona kulikanouela na civembulu. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Kaha kuteja ca vusunga vaka cikunu mu ciyulo kuli vaje vaka kulinga ciyulo.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Vusamba na vaka mavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Nkuma vika vikanehe nzita, kaha nkuma vika naua vikanehe kulua hakati keni? Nkuma keti mashungu eni akeuo ali ku nzita hakati ka vantu veni ndi? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Muka shunguiya vuno honi ku muesi navio, mukemo honi mukatsihi. Kaha mukavitondo cikuma vuno honi kumuekuviuana, nankuma mukemo mukalu na kulinga nzita. Kumuesi navio muomu kumue kulomba. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Mukalombo vuno honi kumue kutambula, muomu kumue kulomba muje mucayilamo, muomu mukalikuasesavio muje muaya mashungu eni. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Yeni vantu vakuhona kulongua! Nkuma ku muazivukile ngueni kulinga vusamba na vaka mavu cinapu vutozi na Njambi ndi? Nankuma, uoshe uje atonda kupua kavusamba ua vaka mavu alipuisa ikeye vavenia kupua citozi ua Njambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Cipue nkuma musinganieka ngueni visoneka vikahandeka viangoco omo vihandeka nguavio, “Njambi ashunguiya mu lifuua ha cimbembesi uje uakala muli yetu ndi?” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Vuno honi akahana kavumbi kakama, nankuma visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Njambi akaluisa kulihalesa, vuno honi akahana kavumbi kuli vaka kulikehesa.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nankuma, lihaneni yeni vavenia kuli Njambi. Luiseni Liyavolo kaha akateua kuli yeni. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Shueneni kuyehi na Njambi kaha na ikeye akashuena kuyehi neni. Leleseni mavoko eni, yeni vaka vupi, kaha leleseni mitima yeni, yeni vantu va mitima ivali. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Pueni vaka kumbolozoka, lileni na kusikoka. Eceleni kujola ceni cipue kulila kaha nakuvuahelela ceni cipue kulisimoka. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Likeheseni yeni vavenia ku mesho a Muene kaha akamijundula.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo caha kusompa mukueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Vamuanetu keti muhandeke via vipi kuli umo na mukuavo. Uoshe uje ahandeka via vipi kuli munaina cipue kusompa munaina, kaha ali nakuluisa lishiko na kusompa lishiko. Vuno honi nga usompa lishiko, kaha yove kuue kulinga vije lishiko litonda vuno honi umukakulisompa. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Kuli umo lika muka kuhana lishiko na kusompa, uje asa kuovola na kunongesa. Nkuma yove iya linga usompe mukueni?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo caha kulihalesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Ijeni honi, yeni vaje mukahandeka ngueni, “Lelo cipue imene, tuya kuje na kuje ku nganda nakukalako muaka nakukalingilako mingoso linga tuuaneko nganio.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Muomu kuuzivuka via imene. Vuyoye vuove muje muvukafua? Yeni munapu mbundu ije ikalako lika kantsimbu kakandende kaha ihua. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Vuno honi munapande kuhandeka ngueni, “Nga cizango ca Muene citava, tukayoya kaha tukalinga eci na cije.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Vuno honi yeni mukalihalesa nakulipamba. Kaha kulihalesa coshe eci cinapu vupi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Uoshe uje azivuka kulinga via vusunga kaha ahonoua kuvilinga, muomu kuli ikeye asinganieka nguendi vinapu vupi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Cinangulo kuli vaka kufuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ijeni honi, yeni vaka kufuka, lileni na kumbolozoka muomu ya vukalu vuje vuli nakuija hali yeni. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Vufuko vueni vunavolo laja na vuzalo vueni vunaliua laja ku tuntembulu. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ngolinde na siliva yeni ili na nkalaue, kaha nkalaue yayo ikapua vukaleho hakati keni, kaha ikalia mivila yeni ngue tuhia. Munalitulikila vufuko mu matangua akumanusuila. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Taleni, yeni kumuafuetele vaje vaka vipangi vaje vapangele mu mehia eni, ije fueto ya vaje imuambatele muvungumba ili na kulila muomu yeni. Kaha kulila ca vaje vaka kuteja cinahete ku matuitui a Muene Uanzili yoshe. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Munayoyo ha mavu vuyoye vua senga na kuvuahelela, muahindalesa mivila yeni ha litangua lia kumitsiha. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Munahisa, nakutsiha muntu ua vusunga, uje kamiluisile.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusimpa na lilombelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nankuma, simpeni vamuanetu, kuvanga noho kuija ca Muene. Taleni, ndimi akavandamena vushuka vuacili vuje vukahumu ha mavu, akasimpi kuvanga noho vuje vushuka vunatambula kalunga uakulivanga na uakumanusuila. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Neni naua pueni vakusimpa na kuimana ngoo, muomu kuija ca Muene cili muyehi. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Vamuanetu, keti mulinieniete hali umo na mukuavo, linga keti vakamisompe. Taleni, Muka kusompa nemana ku vikolo. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Vamuanetu, kusetekesa na cimueso ca kuyanda nakusimpa, tuyeni tucisetekese na tunanguizi vaje vahandekele mu lizina lia Muene. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Taleni, tukatumbula vaje nguetu vaka kuvuahelela vaje vakele nalukakateya. Munovu kusimpa ca Yombi, kaha muamono visinganieka via Muene, muje vati Muene uapua ua ngozi na cikeketima.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Vuno honi ha vioshe evi, vamuanetu keti mulisinge, cipue na lilu cipue na mavu cipue kulisinga na coshe cisingo, vuno honi eyo yeni, ipue eyo na houe yeni, ipue houe, linga keti vaka mihise.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Nkuma kuli umo hakati keni uje ali na kuyanda ndi? Kaha napande kulombela. Nkuma kuli umo navuahelela ndi? Kaha napande kuimba miaso ya kushangazala. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Nkuma kuli umo hakati keni uje ali nakuvavala ndi? Kaha napande kusana vakuluntu va cikungulukilo, kaha vamulombelele nakumuvuavesa na mazi mu lizina lia Muene. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Kaha lilombelo lia lutsilielo lika yoyesa uje muntu ali nakuvavala, kaha Muene akamukanguisa, nga nalingi vupi, vaka mukonekela. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nankuma liambululeni vipi vieni kuli umo na mukuavo, nakulilombelela umo na mukuavo linga mukanguke. Lilombelo lia muntu muka vusunga lili nanzili cikuma kaha likakuasa cikuma. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya uapuile yala mu vuntu ngue yetu kaha ualombelele cikuma linga kalunga keti anoke, kaha ha miaka itatu na vingonde vitanu na imo kalunga kanokele ha mavu. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Ambahoni ualombelele naua kaha lilu lia nokesele kalunga, kaha ha mavu hakele vushuka naua.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Vamuanetu, nga umo hakati keni ahuma ku vusunga kaha umo amuhiluisa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />napande kuzivuka nguendi uoshe uje ahiluisa muka vupi kukupenga penga ca vilinga viendi, akavola muono uendi kukutsa kaha vupi vuendi vuavuingi vaka vukonekela.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>